+      "notes": "Implemented as a nested Controller inside the cronExpression Controller's render prop. Spec shows a sibling Controller pattern at the same JSX nesting level. Nesting causes re-instantiation of the timezone Controller on every cronExpression change, leading to repeated field registration/unregistration overhead and potential form-value loss."
